  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _name: Merchant Governor
  _maxHealth: 100
  Damage: 10
  Defense: 10
  walkSpeed: 0
  quest1State: 0
  quest2State: 0
  quest3State: 0
  interactionTextUI: {fileID: 1199656365}
  TalkingPanel: {fileID: 1941154182}
  TalkingText: {fileID: 736136247}
  TalkingNameText: {fileID: 323756718}
  TalkingLines:
  - HEYYYYYY! Over here!
  - Finally! There is someone pheww...
  - Are you sent here to help me?
  - '? '
  - From the look of your face look like you are not
  - Sooooo How did you get here?
  - Mhm.. Hmmm I see
  - So you are a student that came here to research about magic but got kidnapped
    to here instead?
  - What a bad luck...
  - Me? How did I end up here?
  - Well... You see that creepy looking wizard over there?
  - He want to my money and use me for experiment or something.. Whatever that thing
    said
  - Oh! I forgot to introduce myself
  - I am a "Merchant Governor of Unauna city!
  - Didn't you told me earlier that you want to go there?
  - 'We are heading to the same place! '
  - Well.. I know a way to get out but I couldn't do it myself
  - How? Very easy! All you need to do is fight that [Deathlord]?  or whatever it
    name is.. And take a [Glowing Crystal] to me!
  - I am waiting for you right here OK?
